{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an incremental / roguelike game where you place gears in the play area and spin. The score is added by the end of the spin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each stage, you need to get to the target score before your energy runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark gears gain score when spinning clockwise, and light gears gain score when spinning counter-clockwise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gears can also have functions on their gears that affect the gears they interlock with. For example, x2 doubles the value of the gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027830/extras/47c48f6cda9edfb730fb4aa904b10f80.avif?t=1770903059\" width=386 height=378 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 different functions that can go on the gears.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 Gear up levels, which are added difficulty modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 bolts to add on gears, adding special effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027830?t=1770903059","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027830?t=1770903059","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027830/a6c68a47f993b8852d9392f9f91847a60e640ca6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770903059","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027830/a6c68a47f993b8852d9392f9f91847a60e640ca6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770903059","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4032010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an incremental / roguelike game where you place gears in the play area and spin. The score is added by the end of the spin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each stage, you need to get to the target score before your energy runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark gears gain score when spinning clockwise, and light gears gain score when spinning counter-clockwise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gears can also have functions on their gears that affect the gears they interlock with. For example, x2 doubles the value of the gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027830/extras/47c48f6cda9edfb730fb4aa904b10f80.avif?t=1770903059\" width=386 height=378 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 different functions that can go on the gears.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 Gear up levels, which are added difficulty modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 bolts to add on gears, adding special effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Eyal Hazor"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027830/8a2cbaa5d9dce4133d6c08906be3caadb99daa50/header.jpg?t=1770903059","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04.4<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 70 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4027830/505888942/d16af145f48a300d0708a86ac5d7c83155add9d6/1770834374/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770903